<title>JAPAN: Japan's Charle says to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Japan's Charle says to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's underwear maker Charle Co Ltd said on Friday it would buy back up to 3.3 million, or up to four billion yen worth, of its own shares.</p>
</text>
